%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5a584a25f7a2f6c23a420ed9d0c79f73, type: 3}
  m_Name: npc_ossa
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: AthenHill.Runtime::AthenHill.NpcDefinition
  id: npc_ossa
  displayName: Warden Ossa
  role: West Gate watch
  entries:
  - node: plate_carrier
    requires: order:order_plate_carrier
  - node: long_arm
    requires: order:order_long_arm
  nodes:
  - id: long_arm
    title: Long arm
    text: The relay knoll is west along the trail, past the waystation; two gunner droids nest on it with a worker. Their lasers walk before they fire, so move off the line and shoot the optic. The receiver is on the gunner's rack. Brann builds the rest. Train Rifle in your pack, equip it in your loadout, and 8 draws it out here.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 07a3e883bfc34e6192ff3e10810be64a, type: 3}
    choices:
    - id: range
      label: Remind me of the controls.
      next: range
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: leave
      label: On my way.
      next: 
      action: close
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  - id: plate_carrier
    title: Plate carrier
    text: The caravan is north of the trail, past the northgate drones; the scavengers picking it are workers with a drone. The strongbox is by the lead truck. Wear the carrier in your chest slot; it is heavier than your vest, so mind your carry weight.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4bd79e1f95f44d71ab7131970be851ea, type: 3}
    choices:
    - id: range
      label: Remind me of the controls.
      next: range
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: leave
      label: Understood.
      next: 
      action: close
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  - id: greeting
    title: West Gate watch
    text: Ossa. West Gate watch. Nobody walks the Berms unarmed. The ARMS LOCKER is under the canopy at the post, left of my issue window; the cyan light on top marks it. Rell keeps the return lane clear.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8e60d6d973c54fd48c7363a959029cfc, type: 3}
    choices:
    - id: locker
      label: Where is the locker?
      next: locker
      action: 
    - id: machines
      label: What are those machines?
      next: machines
      action: 
  - id: locker
    title: Arms issue
    text: The green steel cabinet under the shade canopy, next to the crates, with ARMS stencilled on the door and a cyan beacon on top. Walk up to it and press E. Press 7 to draw the pistol outside the walls; it runs on nano charge. The range is across the lane, past the barriers.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 09c46f3a39264a9b84f50cdfa577b3d7, type: 3}
    choices:
    - id: back
      label: Tell me about the machines.
      next: machines
      action: 
    - id: leave
      label: I'll check the locker.
      next: 
      action: close
  - id: machines
    title: Industrial machines
    text: The walkers are cargo-handling droids; the hovering ones are inspection and salvage drones. Feral industrial code makes them treat people as obstacles or raw material. The aquifer service droid inside Ward is maintained and loyal. Keep your aim on the hostile machines beyond the range.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ca67394b345944b79c22beffd9fbf74a, type: 3}
    choices:
    - id: range
      label: How do I use the range?
      next: range
      action: 
    - id: leave
      label: Understood.
      next: 
      action: close
  - id: range
    title: Safe range practice
    text: Draw with 7. Hold right mouse to aim, then left click to fire; F fires from the hip. Knock down all three plates. Watch for the loose drone on the service road afterward. If you get hurt, break contact. Vitality recovers and nano refills when you stop firing.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 45342f2c12824efd9a835c1df7a000f5, type: 3}
    choices:
    - id: back
      label: Where was the locker?
      next: locker
      action: 
    - id: leave
      label: I'm ready.
      next: 
      action: close
